{"unit_id":"Wanbinyu__dsh-billing#card-zh","repo":"Wanbinyu/dsh-billing","commit":"34546de6242bfc703683181225e20fe69ea66360","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-billing 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的会话用量与费用统计插件。它向 session projection 注册 billing 投影，并在消息输入区上方显示费用条。插件按服务商和模型汇总输入、输出及缓存 token，依据配置价格或内置目录计算费用，并展示最新轮次费用、未定价模型提示和可选的会话额度进度。适合希望在对话界面查看模型成本和用量的人。需要配置模型价格与货币；额度显示需设置 quota。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-billing/src/index.ts:24-27","packages/dsh-billing/src/projection.ts:292-364","packages/dsh-client-ui-billing/src/client/BillingBar.tsx:58-100"]}
{"unit_id":"Wanbinyu__dsh-billing#card-en","repo":"Wanbinyu/dsh-billing","commit":"34546de6242bfc703683181225e20fe69ea66360","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-billing tracks token usage and costs in DSH web sessions. It registers a billing projection and shows costs above the composer. Usage is grouped by provider and model, priced from configured rates or a built-in catalog. The strip shows session costs, unpriced models, and optional quota progress.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-billing/src/index.ts:24-27","packages/dsh-billing/src/projection.ts:292-364","packages/dsh-client-ui-billing/src/client/BillingBar.tsx:58-100"]}
